Off-diagonal \code{e} is the GLM analogue of E covariances (shared unique /
measurement error). Family leftover is still independent given eta.
Unique environment is the \code{e} latent \strong{and} the family leftover. \code{nAGQ} is 1.
Cholesky is \code{nVar}-general. MZ Laplace dimension is \code{4 * nVar} latents.

\strong{Bernoulli: fix e diagonal at 1.} Leftover (probit 1, logit \eqn{\pi^2/3})
